ewBox=\"0 0 114.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 12.0 12.0 21.0 29.3 29.3 36.7 52.6 59.3 68.3 68.3 86.3 97.6 97.6 104.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"21.0 59.3 104.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » deyip durmasınlar 60. </p>"}